*  BCD_EBCD_driver - exercises bcd_ebcd.spt, a one-line PROGRAM (not a library
*  module) that converts BCD input to EBCDIC by REPLACE(INPUT,"#@%<&","='()+").
*  It reads INPUT, so the cases are supplied by bcd_ebcd_driver.input, the
*  corpus's `${sno%.sno}.input` convention.
-INCLUDE "bcd_ebcd.spt"
